    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate VR Fighting Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recharged</strong> brings <strong>high-impact robotic combat</strong> to VR, letting you take full control of powerful mechanized warriors in intense 1v1 battles. Every punch, block, and counter is <strong>mapped directly to your movements</strong>, making every fight an electrifying test of skill and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your robotic fighter, master unique special moves, and <strong>outmaneuver your opponent in fast-paced, animation-based battles</strong>. Whether you're a casual brawler or a hardcore competitor, <strong>Recharged</strong> offers an adrenaline-fueled experience with deep combat mechanics and immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>diverse roster of robotic warriors</strong>, each featuring <strong>unique abilities</strong> and combat styles, no two fights ever feel the same. The game\u2019s advanced hit recognition system ensures fluid, responsive movement, making every strike feel weighty and impactful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>ranked matches, tournaments, and mini-game leaderboards</strong>, where only the best will rise to the top. Train offline against AI opponents, refine skills, and prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction is the heart of <i>Recharged</i>. With<strong>\u00a0real-time gestures</strong>, the game fosters a lively and competitive community. Whether you're taunting an opponent before a match or celebrating a hard-earned victory, every fight feels personal and intense.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ultimate VR Fighting Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recharged</strong> brings <strong>high-impact robotic combat</strong> to VR, letting you take full control of powerful mechanized warriors in intense 1v1 battles. Every punch, block, and counter is <strong>mapped directly to your movements</strong>, making every fight an electrifying test of skill and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/d0f3c6b28c4c8da22ea7ac28132d6cc1.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your robotic fighter, master unique special moves, and <strong>outmaneuver your opponent in fast-paced, animation-based battles</strong>. Whether you're a casual brawler or a hardcore competitor, <strong>Recharged</strong> offers an adrenaline-fueled experience with deep combat mechanics and immersive environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/cc1ef57ceb85d4336c52e6674506c63a.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>diverse roster of robotic warriors</strong>, each featuring <strong>unique abilities</strong> and combat styles, no two fights ever feel the same. The game\u2019s advanced hit recognition system ensures fluid, responsive movement, making every strike feel weighty and impactful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.poster.avif?t=1755158736\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.webm?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708050/extras/99361ee792b2173d69b25735a27edf68.mp4?t=1755158736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>ranked matches, tournaments, and mini-game leaderboards</strong>, where only the best will rise to the top. Train offline against AI opponents, refine skills, and prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction is the heart of <i>Recharged</i>. With<strong>\u00a0real-time gestures</strong>, the game fosters a lively and competitive community. Whether you're taunting an opponent before a match or celebrating a hard-earned victory, every fight feels personal and intense.</p>",
    "short_description": "Take control of heavyweight robotic fighters in brutal, real-time duels. Throw your punches in a combat system driven by precise animations and timing. Chain devastating combos, outmaneuver your rivals, and prove you're the ultimate pilot in this visceral, competitive experience.",
